          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गृहस्थी — gṛhasthī — \"a household; family life\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शादी के बाद मीरा ने अपनी गृहस्थी सँभाली। śādī ke bād Mīrā ne apnī gṛhasthī sãbhālī. After her marriage Mira took charge of her household."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गृहस्थी (gṛhasthī) is Sanskrit gṛhastha, \"a householder\", built on gṛha, \"house\", and stha, \"standing in\" (Monier-Williams), with the ending -ī: the life and business of a household."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
