          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मुखिया (mukhiyā) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Hindi mukhyā, \"chief\", under Sanskrit múkhya, \"pertaining to the face\" and \"chief\" (CDIAL 10174); mukhiyā is the usual spelling. múkhya is built on múkha, \"face, front\", the word behind mũh."
